<title>PORTUGAL: Portuguese bonds close down on EMU jitters, escudo.</title>
<headline>Portuguese bonds close down on EMU jitters, escudo.</headline>
<text>
<p>1625 GMT - Bonds ended lower in sympathy with other southern European markets which lost on waning confidence Italy will join the single currency. Future trend dependent on foreign mood.</p>
<p>*June 97 down 39 basis points at 107.14</p>
<p>*Feb 07 cash 99.00 vs 99.20. Yld 6.76 vs 6.73</p>
<p>*Spread vs Spanish 10-yr cash -14 bps vs -11 bps</p>
</text>
